  <h2>Traditional Meals of Bangladesh</h2>
  <p>Popular dishes include biryani, hilsa fish curry, bhuna khichuri, and street snacks like fuchka and chotpoti. Meals are often served with rice, lentils, and seasonal vegetables.</p>
